cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "SAFE-Fire: code and frozen evaluation records"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen evaluation records, device logs and figures supporting a study of
  false-alarm rates in indoor fire detection. Includes automated hard-negative
  mining, conformal alarm thresholding with a training-conditional extension,
  a temporal verification layer, and measurements from a deployed Jetson Nano.
